Package: com.hakmicapitalgroup.hcgnexus
Name: HCG Nexus
Version: 0.3.1~beta1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: HCG command panel behind a configurable cyan edge handle: Overview, Workspaces, Tools, HCG Products, Apps and Account. Command Mode shows device status and HCG integration states. With HCG Halo 0.2.0~beta1 or later installed, Halo can draw an animated border around the panel (optional). Off after installation; enable it in Settings > HCG Nexus. Candidate build, not yet verified on a physical device.
Maintainer: Hakmi Capital Group
Author: Hakmi Capital Group
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate | ellekit, preferenceloader
